2026-05-21T03:55:10.240007Z  INFO ThreadId(15) universal_search_service::service: 683: Claude API response: {"content":[{"thinking":"","type":"thinking"},{"text":"Based on my research, here's a comprehensive summary of Polymarket's CLOB REST API, focusing on book price midpoint public endpoints and rate limits for 2025-2026:\n\n## Polymarket CLOB REST API: Midpoint Price Endpoints\n\nPolymarket provides several **public endpoints** for retrieving midpoint prices from the Central Limit Order Book (CLOB). These endpoints are available on the CLOB API base URL: `https://clob.polymarket.com`\n\n### Midpoint Price Endpoints\n\n1. **Get single midpoint price**\n   - `GET /midpoint`\n   - Query parameter: `token_id` (required)\n   - Returns: `{ \"mid\": \"0.6500\" }`\n\n2. **Get multiple midpoint prices (query parameters)**\n   - `GET /midpoints`\n   - Query parameter: `token_ids` (comma-separated list, required)\n   - Returns: `{ \"token_id_1\": \"0.45\", \"token_id_2\": \"0.52\" }`\n\n3. **Get multiple midpoint prices (request body)**\n   - `POST /midpoints`\n   - Request body: `{ \"token_ids\": [\"id1\", \"id2\"] }`\n   - Returns: Map of token IDs to midpoint prices\n\n### Rate Limits for Midpoint Endpoints (2025-2026)\n\nAccording to the official Polymarket documentation, the rate limits for these endpoints are:\n\n| Endpoint | Rate Limit |\n|----------|------------|\n| `/midpoint` | 1,500 requests / 10 seconds |\n| `/midpoints` | 500 requests / 10 seconds |\n\n**Key Details:**\n- All API rate limits are enforced using Cloudflare's throttling system\n- When limits are exceeded, requests are **throttled (delayed/queued)** rather than immediately rejected\n- Limits reset on sliding time windows\n- These limits are per API key/IP (for public endpoints)\n\n### Other Relevant Market Data Rate Limits\n\nFor context, here are related CLOB market data endpoints:\n\n| Endpoint | Rate Limit |\n|----------|------------|\n| `/book` | 1,500 req / 10s |\n| `/books` | 500 req / 10s |\n| `/price` | 1,500 req / 10s |\n| `/prices` | 500 req / 10s |\n| `/prices-history` | 1,000 req / 10s |\n| Market tick size | 200 req / 10s |\n\n### General CLOB API Limits\n\n- **General CLOB API**: 9,000 requests / 10 seconds\n- **Health check** (`/ok`): 100 requests / 10 seconds\n\n### Important Notes\n\n1. **Public Access**: Midpoint price endpoints are **public** and do not require authentication\n2. **Token IDs**: You need the specific token ID for each outcome (Yes/No) to query prices\n3. **Midpoint Calculation**: The midpoint is calculated as the average of the best bid and best ask prices\n4. **No Official Sandbox**: Polymarket does not provide a testnet; all API calls interact with the live system\n\n### Sources\n\n- Official Polymarket API Documentation: https://docs.polymarket.com/api-reference/rate-limits\n- Midpoint Price Endpoint Documentation: https://docs.polymarket.com/api-reference/market-data/get-midpoint-prices-query-parameters\n\nThe rate limits shown here are current as of 2025 and are expected to remain stable through 2026, though always check the official documentation for any updates.","type":"text"}],"id":"dc39615e32cd4a1392e6ccb303aad013","model":"kat-coder-pro-v2","role":"assistant","stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"cache_read_input_tokens":34464,"input_tokens":4985,"output_tokens":819}}
