2026-05-25T02:15:05.341438Z  INFO ThreadId(11) universal_search_service::service: 683: Claude API response: {"content":[{"thinking":"","type":"thinking"},{"text":"Based on my research, here is comprehensive information about the Phi-4 GGUF model for use with llama.cpp:\n\n## Phi-4 Model Overview\n\n**Phi-4** is a state-of-the-art open language model developed by Microsoft Research, specifically designed for memory/compute constrained environments and reasoning tasks.\n\n### Key Specifications\n- **Parameters**: 14B (dense decoder-only Transformer)\n- **Context Length**: 16K tokens\n- **Training Data**: 9.8T tokens (synthetic datasets, filtered public domain websites, academic books, Q&A datasets)\n- **Release Date**: December 12, 2024\n- **License**: MIT\n- **Architecture**: phi3\n\n### Performance Highlights (vs other models)\n- **MMLU**: 84.8 (outperforms GPT-4o-mini at 81.8)\n- **GPQA (Science)**: 56.1 (significantly higher than competitors)\n- **MATH**: 80.4 (strong math reasoning)\n- **HumanEval (Code)**: 82.6\n\n## Using Phi-4 with llama.cpp\n\n### Installation & Basic Usage\n\nMicrosoft provides official GGUF quantizations on Hugging Face:\n- Repository: `microsoft/phi-4-gguf`\n- Multiple quantization options available (1-bit to 16-bit)\n\n**Recommended command for 4-bit quantized model:**\n```bash\n~/llama.cpp/build/bin/llama-cli -m phi-4-q4.gguf -cnv -c 16384 -p \"You are a medieval knight and must provide explanations to modern people.\"\n```\n\n### Available Quantization Formats & Sizes\n- **1-bit**: TQ1_0 (3.59 GB)\n- **2-bit**: Q2_K (5.55 GB), TQ2_0 (4.23 GB)\n- **3-bit**: IQ3_XXS (6.08 GB), IQ3_XS (6.25 GB), IQ3_S (6.5 GB), Q3_K_S (6.5 GB), IQ3_M (6.91 GB), Q3_K_L (7.93 GB)\n- **4-bit**: IQ4_XS (8.01 GB), Q4_K_S (8.44 GB), IQ4_NL (8.44 GB), Q4_0 (8.38 GB), Q4_1 (9.27 GB)\n- **5-bit**: Q5_K_S (10.2 GB), Q5_0 (10.2 GB), Q5_1 (11 GB)\n- **6-bit**: Q6_K (12 GB)\n- **8-bit**: Q8_0 (15.6 GB)\n- **16-bit**: BF16 (29.3 GB)\n\n### Chat Template Format\nPhi-4 is optimized for chat format:\n```\n","type":"text"}],"id":"3a8e35ef012e44d9a82755b80fe047e1","model":"kat-coder-pro-v2","role":"assistant","stop_reason":"stop_sequence","stop_sequence":"<|im_start|>","type":"message","usage":{"cache_read_input_tokens":23660,"input_tokens":4172,"output_tokens":649}}
