2026-05-25T02:15:24.792596Z  INFO ThreadId(14) universal_search_service::service: 683: Claude API response: {"content":[{"thinking":"","type":"thinking"},{"text":"Based on the official llama.cpp documentation, here is the comprehensive list of **multimodal vision models** supported by llama.cpp as of 2025:\n\n## Vision Models\n\n### Gemma Series\n- **Gemma 3**: 4B, 12B, 27B variants\n- **Gemma 4**: E2B, E4B, 26B-A4B, 31B variants\n\n### SmolVLM Series\n- SmolVLM-Instruct\n- SmolVLM-256M-Instruct\n- SmolVLM-500M-Instruct\n- SmolVLM2-2.2B-Instruct\n- SmolVLM2-256M-Video-Instruct\n- SmolVLM2-500M-Video-Instruct\n\n### Qwen Vision Models\n- **Qwen2 VL**: 2B, 7B\n- **Qwen2.5 VL**: 3B, 7B, 32B, 72B\n\n### InternVL Series\n- **InternVL 2.5**: 1B, 4B\n- **InternVL 3**: 1B, 2B, 8B, 14B\n\n### Other Vision Models\n- **Pixtral 12B**\n- **Mistral Small 3.1 24B** (IQ2_M quantization)\n- **Llama 4 Scout** (17B-16E-Instruct)\n- **Moondream2** (20250414 version)\n\n## Audio Models\n\n- **Ultravox 0.5** (based on Llama 3.2 1B and Llama 3.1 8B)\n- **Mistral's Voxtral** (Mini-3B-2507)\n- **Qwen3-ASR** (0.6B, 1.7B)\n\n## Mixed Modality Models (Vision + Audio)\n\n- **Qwen2.5 Omni** (3B, 7B)\n- **Qwen3 Omni** (30B-A3B-Instruct, 30B-A3B-Thinking)\n- **Gemma 4** (E2B, E4B variants)\n\n## Usage\n\nThese models can be used with:\n- `llama-mtmd-cli` for command-line interaction\n- `llama-server` for API access via OpenAI-compatible `/chat/completions` endpoint\n\nExample usage:\n```bash\nllama-server -hf ggml-org/gemma-3-4b-it-GGUF\n```\n\n**Source**: Official llama.cpp multimodal documentation - https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/blob/master/docs/multimodal.md","type":"text"}],"id":"8ec4d02b1b8e48d7bac2baec0de9f317","model":"kat-coder-pro-v2","role":"assistant","stop_reason":"stop_sequence","stop_sequence":"248046","type":"message","usage":{"cache_read_input_tokens":22580,"input_tokens":2896,"output_tokens":615}}
