2026-05-26T02:06:59.678911Z  INFO ThreadId(15) universal_search_service::service: 683: Claude API response: {"content":[{"thinking":"","type":"thinking"},{"text":"Based on the LongCat-Video technical documentation and source code analysis, here is the **attention backend priority chain** for the model as of 2026:\n\n## LongCat Attention Backend Priority Chain\n\nThe system implements a **four-tier priority-based selection mechanism** for attention computation:\n\n### Priority Order:\n1. **Block Sparse Attention (BSA)** - Highest priority\n2. **FlashAttention-3 (FA3)**\n3. **FlashAttention-2 (FA2)**\n4. **xFormers** - Fallback option\n\n### Selection Logic Details:\n\n**Block Sparse Attention (Priority 1)**\n- Selected when `enable_bsa=True` AND temporal dimension > 1\n- Custom Triton-based implementation optimized for 3D video data\n- Reduces attention computations to <10% of dense attention\n- Specifically designed for long video sequences\n\n**FlashAttention-3 (Priority 2)**\n- Latest optimizations with enhanced performance\n- Requires Hopper+ GPUs (H100, H200)\n- Uses tensor format `[B, S, H, D]`\n- Provides best performance when available\n\n**FlashAttention-2 (Priority 3)**\n- Default high-performance backend\n- Broad hardware compatibility (Ampere+ GPUs: A100, RTX 30xx+)\n- Standard format `[B, H, S, D]`\n- Most commonly used fallback\n\n**xFormers (Priority 4)**\n- Memory-efficient attention implementation\n- Works on most modern GPUs\n- Format: `[B, M, H, K]`\n- Used when other backends are unavailable\n\n### Special Cases:\n- **Cross-Attention**: BSA is excluded; uses FlashAttention backends with `flash_attn_varlen_func` for variable-length sequences\n- **Single-frame processing**: BSA is skipped when temporal dimension = 1\n\n### Performance Impact:\nAccording to the technical report, combining BSA with coarse-to-fine generation achieves **12.3× speedup** for 720p video generation compared to native dense attention.\n\n**Sources:**\n- [LongCat-Video Technical Report](https://arxiv.org/html/2510.22200)\n- [Attention Backend Selection Documentation](https://deepwiki.com/meituan-longcat/LongCat-Video/6.2-attention-backend-selection)\n- [GitHub Source Code](https://github.com/meituan-longcat/LongCat-Video)","type":"text"}],"id":"7111043f4c584f07912ce17c9ea11a67","model":"kat-coder-pro-v2","role":"assistant","stop_reason":"stop_sequence","stop_sequence":"248046","type":"message","usage":{"cache_read_input_tokens":62968,"input_tokens":5549,"output_tokens":530}}
