2026-05-27T03:05:25.212176Z  INFO ThreadId(13) universal_search_service::service: 683: Claude API response: {"content":[{"thinking":"","type":"thinking"},{"text":"Based on my research, here's how to run inference with the **NVIDIA Nemotron-3-Nano-Omni** model (Mamba2-Transformer hybrid architecture) using **llama.cpp**:\n\n## Quick Start Guide\n\n### 1. Build llama.cpp with GPU Support\n```bash\n# Install dependencies (Ubuntu/Debian)\napt-get update\napt-get install build-essential cmake curl libcurl4-openssl-dev -y\n\n# Clone and build\ngit clone https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp\ncd llama.cpp\ncmake -B build -DBUILD_SHARED_LIBS=OFF -DGGML_CUDA=ON -DLLAMA_CURL=ON\ncmake --build build --config Release -j --target llama-cli llama-mtmd-cli llama-server\n```\n\n### 2. Download the Model\nThe model is available in GGUF format from Hugging Face:\n\n```bash\npip install huggingface_hub\n\n# Download the 4-bit quantized version (recommended)\nhf download unsloth/NVIDIA-Nemotron-3-Nano-Omni-30B-A3B-Reasoning-GGUF \\\n    --local-dir ./nemotron-omni \\\n    --include \"*mmproj-BF16*\" \\\n    --include \"*UD-Q4_K_XL*\"\n```\n\n**Model files needed:**\n- Main model: `NVIDIA-Nemotron-3-Nano-Omni-30B-A3B-Reasoning-UD-Q4_K_XL.gguf`\n- Vision projector: `mmproj-BF16.gguf` (required for image input)\n\n### 3. Run Inference\n\n#### Interactive Chat with Image Support\n```bash\n./llama-cli \\\n    --model ./nemotron-omni/NVIDIA-Nemotron-3-Nano-Omni-30B-A3B-Reasoning-UD-Q4_K_XL.gguf \\\n    --mmproj ./nemotron-omni/mmproj-BF16.gguf \\\n    --temp 1.0 \\\n    --top-p 1.0 \\\n    --min-p 0.01 \\\n    -cnv\n```\n\n#### Deploy as OpenAI-Compatible Server\n```bash\n./llama-server \\\n    --model ./nemotron-omni/NVIDIA-Nemotron-3-Nano-Omni-30B-A3B-Reasoning-UD-Q4_K_XL.gguf \\\n    --mmproj ./nemotron-omni/mmproj-BF16.gguf \\\n    --alias \"nemotron-omni\" \\\n    --temp 1.0 \\\n    --top-p 1.0 \\\n    --port 8001\n```\n\nThen use with OpenAI client:\n```python\nfrom openai import OpenAI\n\nclient = OpenAI(\n    base_url=\"http://127.0.0.1:8001/v1\",\n    api_key=\"sk-no-key-required\"\n)\n\n# Text-only query\nresponse = client.chat.completions.create(\n    model=\"nemotron-omni\",\n    messages=[{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"What is 2+2?\"}]\n)\nprint(response.choices[0].message.content)\n\n# With image input\nimport base64\nwith open(\"image.png\", \"rb\") as f:\n    image_data = base64.b64encode(f.read()).decode()\n    \nresponse = client.chat.completions.create(\n    model=\"nemotron-omni\",\n    messages=[{\n        \"role\": \"user\",\n        \"content\": [\n            {\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"What is in this image?\"},\n            {\"type\": \"image_url\", \"image_url\": {\"url\": f\"data:image/png;base64,{image_data}\"}}\n        ]\n    }]\n)\n```\n\n## Key Parameters\n\n**Recommended inference settings:**\n- **General chat**: `temperature=1.0`, `top_p=1.0`\n- **Tool calling**: `temperature=0.6`, `top_p=0.95`\n\n**Memory requirements:**\n- 4-bit quantized: ~25GB RAM\n- 8-bit quantized: ~36GB RAM\n\n## Important Notes\n\n1. **CUDA Warning**: Avoid CUDA 13.2 as it may produce gibberish outputs (NVIDIA is working on a fix)\n2. **Multimodal**: The model supports text, images, audio, video, and documents as input, but currently only text output\n3. **Context**: Supports up to 256K tokens\n4. **Architecture**: This is a hybrid Mamba2-Transformer model with Mixture-of-Experts (30B total, 3B active parameters)\n\n## Alternative: Unsloth Studio\nFor a user-friendly GUI experience, you can use [Unsloth Studio](https://unsloth.ai/docs/new/studio), which provides automatic setup and built-in support for Nemotron models with drag-and-drop interface.\n\n**Sources:**\n- [Unsloth Nemotron-3-Nano-Omni Guide](https://unsloth.ai/docs/models/nemotron-3-nano-omni)\n- [llama.cpp Nemotron Performance Discussion](https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/discussions/20421)\n- [Hugging Face Model Repository](https://huggingface.co/unsloth/NVIDIA-Nemotron-3-Nano-Omni-30B-A3B-Reasoning-GGUF)","type":"text"}],"id":"90ba9f65e4d646eb9843f38395d75781","model":"kat-coder-pro-v2","role":"assistant","stop_reason":"stop_sequence","stop_sequence":"248046","type":"message","usage":{"cache_read_input_tokens":23620,"input_tokens":7488,"output_tokens":1211}}
