2026-06-01T14:02:33.266725Z  INFO ThreadId(15) universal_search_service::service: 683: Claude API response: {"content":[{"thinking":"","type":"thinking"},{"text":"I'll help you find information about the Phi-4-multimodal-instruct model's audio transcription and speech recognition prompt format.\n\n","type":"text"},{"id":"call_dc21f2da9c40485bb84d5326","input":{"query":"Phi-4-multimodal-instruct audio transcription prompt format speech recognition"},"name":"search","type":"tool_use"}],"id":"2a93b6aefb904c5f998e3fb1bba6c8b1","model":"kat-coder-pro-v2","role":"assistant","stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":1003,"output_tokens":64}}
2026-06-01T14:02:57.604110Z  INFO ThreadId(15) universal_search_service::service: 683: Claude API response: {"content":[{"thinking":"","type":"thinking"},{"text":"Based on my research, here is the audio transcription prompt format for Phi-4-multimodal-instruct:\n\n## Speech-Language Format for Audio Transcription\n\nThe model uses a specific chat format for audio tasks. For **Automatic Speech Recognition (ASR)**, the prompt format is:\n\n```\n<|user|><|audio_1|>Transcribe the audio clip into text.<|end|><|assistant|>\n```\n\n### Key Components:\n- `<|user|>` - User role token\n- `<|audio_1|>` - Audio placeholder (first audio input)\n- Task instruction: \"Transcribe the audio clip into text.\"\n- `<|end|>` - End of user message\n- `<|assistant|>` - Assistant role token (where the model begins generation)\n\n### Other Speech Task Prompts:\n\n**Speech Translation:**\n```\n<|user|><|audio_1|>Translate the audio to {lang}.<|end|><|assistant|>\n```\n\n**Speech Translation with Chain-of-Thought:**\n```\n<|user|><|audio_1|>Transcribe the audio to text, and then translate the audio to {lang}. Use <sep> as a separator between the original transcript and the translation.<|end|><|assistant|>\n```\n\n**Spoken-Query Question Answering:**\n```\n<|user|><|audio_1|><|end|><|assistant|>\n```\n(No task prompt needed, just the audio)\n\n## Implementation Example\n\nHere's a complete code example from the official PhiCookBook:\n\n```python\nimport torch\nimport soundfile\nfrom transformers import AutoModelForCausalLM, AutoProcessor, GenerationConfig\n\nmodel_path = 'microsoft/Phi-4-multimodal-instruct'\n\nprocessor = AutoProcessor.from_pretrained(model_path, trust_remote_code=True)\nmodel = AutoModelForCausalLM.from_pretrained(\n    model_path,\n    trust_remote_code=True,\n    torch_dtype='auto',\n    _attn_implementation='flash_attention_2',\n).cuda()\n\ngeneration_config = GenerationConfig.from_pretrained(model_path)\n\nuser_prompt = '<|user|>'\nassistant_prompt = '<|assistant|>'\nprompt_suffix = '<|end|>'\n\nspeech_prompt = \"Transcribe the audio clip into text.\"\nprompt = f'{user_prompt}<|audio_1|>{speech_prompt}{prompt_suffix}{assistant_prompt}'\n\naudio = soundfile.read('./audio_file.wav')\n\ninputs = processor(text=prompt, audios=[audio], return_tensors='pt').to('cuda:0')\n\ngenerate_ids = model.generate(\n    **inputs,\n    max_new_tokens=1200,\n    generation_config=generation_config,\n)\n\ngenerate_ids = generate_ids[:, inputs['input_ids'].shape[1]:]\nresponse = processor.batch_decode(\n    generate_ids, skip_special_tokens=True, clean_up_tokenization_spaces=False\n)[0]\n\nprint(response)\n```\n\n## Important Notes:\n\n- The model supports audio up to **40 seconds** for most tasks, or up to **30 minutes** for summarization tasks\n- Supported audio languages: English, Chinese, German, French, Italian, Japanese, Spanish, Portuguese\n- Audio should be loaded using `soundfile` and passed as a tuple `(audio_array, sample_rate)` or just the array\n- The model uses the `o200k_base` tokenizer with 200,064 vocabulary size\n- Requires transformers >= 4.48.2, torch >= 2.6.0, and flash_attention_2 for optimal performance\n\nSources:\n- Hugging Face model card: https://huggingface.co/microsoft/Phi-4-multimodal-instruct\n- PhiCookBook transcription example: https://github.com/microsoft/PhiCookBook/blob/main/md/02.Application/05.Audio/Phi4/Transciption/README.md\n- Technical report: https://arxiv.org/html/2503.01743v1","type":"text"}],"id":"bc9a5b230f134ee48558abf075a4392b","model":"kat-coder-pro-v2","role":"assistant","stop_reason":"stop_sequence","stop_sequence":"248046","type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":81384,"output_tokens":869}}
