2026-06-03T01:00:38.662692Z  INFO ThreadId(16) universal_search_service::service: 685: Claude API response: {"content":[{"thinking":"","type":"thinking"},{"text":"Based on my research, here is comprehensive information about the **Nemotron-3-Nano-30B-A3B GGUF** for llama.cpp:\n\n## Model Overview\n\n**NVIDIA Nemotron-3-Nano-30B-A3B** is a state-of-the-art language model featuring:\n- **30B total parameters** with only **3.5B active parameters** (Mixture-of-Experts architecture)\n- Hybrid Mamba2-Transformer architecture with 52 layers\n- 128K token context window (supports up to 1M tokens)\n- Strong reasoning capabilities with `<think>` and `</think>` tokens\n- Supports English, German, Spanish, French, Italian, and Japanese\n- Commercial use allowed under NVIDIA Open Model License\n\n## GGUF Quantization Options\n\nThe model is available in multiple quantizations for llama.cpp:\n\n| Quantization | VRAM Required | File Size | Quality |\n|--------------|---------------|-----------|---------|\n| Q4_K_M (recommended) | 19.8 GB | 18.0 GB | Best balance |\n| Q5_K_M | 23.5 GB | 21.4 GB | Higher quality |\n| Q8_0 | 33 GB | 30.0 GB | Near-lossless |\n| Q3_K_S | 14.4 GB | 13.1 GB | Smaller size |\n\n## Running with llama.cpp\n\n### Installation\n```bash\n# Build llama.cpp with CUDA support (optional)\ngit clone https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp\ncmake llama.cpp -B llama.cpp/build -DBUILD_SHARED_LIBS=OFF -DGGML_CUDA=ON\ncmake --build llama.cpp/build --config Release -j\n```\n\n### Download Model\n```bash\npip install huggingface_hub hf_transfer\n# Download specific quantization\nhuggingface-cli download unsloth/Nemotron-3-Nano-30B-A3B-GGUF --include \"*Q4_K_M*\"\n```\n\n### Inference Command\n```bash\n./llama.cpp/llama-cli \\\n  --model Nemotron-3-Nano-30B-A3B-Q4_K_M.gguf \\\n  --ctx-size 32768 \\\n  --temp 1.0 --top-p 1.0 \\\n  --special  # Important: shows <think>/</think> tokens\n```\n\n### Key Parameters\n- **For reasoning tasks**: `temperature=1.0, top_p=1.0`\n- **For tool calling**: `temperature=0.6, top_p=0.95`\n- Use `--special` flag to see reasoning tokens\n- Context can be increased up to 1M tokens if hardware allows\n\n## Hardware Requirements\n\n- **Minimum**: 24GB VRAM for Q4_K_M (RTX 3090/4090, Mac Studio M2 Ultra)\n- **Recommended**: 32GB+ for comfortable inference with longer contexts\n- Can run on Apple Silicon Macs with unified memory (24GB+)\n\n## Performance\n\n- On RTX 4090: ~33 tokens/second\n- On Mac Studio M2 Ultra: ~26 tokens/second\n- Excels at reasoning, coding, math, and agentic tasks\n\n## Sources\n\n- [Hugging Face Model Page](https://huggingface.co/unsloth/Nemotron-3-Nano-30B-A3B-GGUF)\n- [Unsloth Documentation](https://unsloth.ai/docs/models/nemotron-3)\n- [Technical Report](https://research.nvidia.com/labs/nemotron/files/NVIDIA-Nemotron-3-Nano-Technical-Report.pdf)","type":"text"}],"id":"7503f15978ad4b7db9475806e54fcc23","model":"kat-coder-pro-v2","role":"assistant","stop_reason":"stop_sequence","stop_sequence":"248046","type":"message","usage":{"cache_read_input_tokens":42132,"input_tokens":27264,"output_tokens":817}}
