2026-06-03T01:01:10.694316Z  INFO ThreadId(13) universal_search_service::service: 685: Claude API response: {"content":[{"thinking":"","type":"thinking"},{"text":"The repository **ggml-org/Nemotron-3-Nano-30B-A3B-GGUF** on Hugging Face contains GGUF-quantized versions of NVIDIA's Nemotron-3-Nano-30B-A3B model, converted for use with llama.cpp and other GGML-based inference engines.\n\n## Key Details\n\n- **Model Origin**: Converted from NVIDIA's original [NVIDIA-Nemotron-3-Nano-30B-A3B-BF16](https://huggingface.co/nvidia/NVIDIA-Nemotron-3-Nano-30B-A3B-BF16) using `convert_hf_to_gguf.py`\n- **Architecture**: Nemotron Hybrid MoE (Mixture of Experts) with 30B total parameters (3.5B active)\n- **Context Length**: Up to 1M tokens (default configured as 256k)\n- **License**: NVIDIA Nemotron Open Model License (commercial use allowed)\n\n## Available Files\n\nThe repository provides three quantization variants:\n\n| File | Size | Quantization |\n|------|------|--------------|\n| `Nemotron-Nano-3-30B-A3B.gguf` | 63.2 GB | Full precision (BF16) |\n| `Nemotron-Nano-3-30B-A3B-Q4_K_M.gguf` | 24.5 GB | 4-bit (Q4_K_M) |\n| `Nemotron-Nano-3-30B-A3B-Q8_0.gguf` | 33.6 GB | 8-bit (Q8_0) |\n\n## Usage\n\nThe recommended way to run this model is with `llama-server` from llama.cpp:\n\n```bash\nllama-server -hf ggml-org/Nemotron-Nano-3-30B-A3B-GGUF -c 0\n```\n\nThen access the OpenAI-compatible API at `http://localhost:8080`.\n\n## Model Capabilities\n\n- **Reasoning**: Built-in \"thinking\" mode that generates reasoning traces before final answers\n- **Tool Calling**: Supports function calling via chat template\n- **Multilingual**: English, Spanish, French, German, Italian, Japanese\n- **Long Context**: Up to 1M tokens\n\n## Downloads\n\nThe model has been downloaded 11,664 times in the last month (as of the latest data).\n\n## Source\n\n- Hugging Face Repository: https://huggingface.co/ggml-org/Nemotron-Nano-3-30B-A3B-GGUF\n- Original NVIDIA Model: https://huggingface.co/nvidia/NVIDIA-Nemotron-3-Nano-30B-A3B-BF16","type":"text"}],"id":"2e805700275540069eeba6ae165228b0","model":"kat-coder-pro-v2","role":"assistant","stop_reason":"stop_sequence","stop_sequence":"248046","type":"message","usage":{"cache_read_input_tokens":33248,"input_tokens":1730,"output_tokens":603}}
